    "description": "Armory, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 486 blocks vs 310. Roof spruce, not stone brick (an all-grey roof read as one block). Strong stone store for the guard's weapons and armour: racks visible through the door, footlockers, grindstone workstation, a stair to the armorer's loft; L2 adds the repair forge lean-to (smithing table, anvil, blast furnace), L3 an outdoor arms rack. Not yet builder-tested: anvil, blast_furnace, iron_bars, red_wall_banner, smithing_table. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern.",
